      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Simplify the expression $x\\cdot {x}^{2}.$",
      "worked_solution": "We add the exponents, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x\\cdot {x}^{2} & = \\\\ {x}^{1}\\cdot {x}^{2} & = \\\\ {x}^{1+2} & = \\\\ {x}^{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
