    "q-22278": {
      "dom_id": "step-q22278",
      "name": "Question 6",
      "problem": "Use exponents to rewrite the product $b\\cdot {b}^{2}\\cdot {c}^{3}\\cdot {b}^{4}\\cdot {c}^{5}\\cdot {c}^{6}\\cdot {b}^{7}.$",
      "worked_solution": "Here we have two variables, $b$ and $c.$ We will start by grouping the two variables separately: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b\\cdot {b}^{2}\\cdot {c}^{3}\\cdot {b}^{4}\\cdot {c}^{5}\\cdot {c}^{6}\\cdot {b}^{7} & = \\\\ {b}^{1}\\cdot {b}^{2}\\cdot {b}^{4}\\cdot {b}^{7}\\cdot {c}^{3}\\cdot {c}^{5}\\cdot {c}^{6} & = \\\\ ({b}^{1}\\cdot {b}^{2}\\cdot {b}^{4}\\cdot {b}^{7})\\cdot ({c}^{3}\\cdot {c}^{5}\\cdot {c}^{6})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis way, we can apply the product rule to the two variables independently:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}({b}^{1}\\cdot {b}^{2}\\cdot {b}^{4}\\cdot {b}^{7})\\cdot ({c}^{3}\\cdot {c}^{5}\\cdot {c}^{6}) & = \\\\ {b}^{(1+2+4+7)}\\cdot {c}^{(3+5+6)} & = \\\\ {b}^{14}{c}^{14}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-22278-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "{b}^{7}\\cdot {c}^{6}",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"46\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"3\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D450 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>b</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
