"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.6em 0.6em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>This way, we can apply the product rule to the two variables independently:\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"54\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 13.293em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.3em;\"><mjx-mrow><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-sop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28 TEX-S1\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-ms